id: mimicry-of-the-whipping-tail-second-effect
name: Mimicry of the Whipping Tail
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: true
requiresTarget: true
usageLimit: 1/round
profile: simple
foundation: physical
fromTrait: mimicry-of-the-whipping-tail
fromEffect: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Mimicry of the Whipping Tail's second effect, as a Maneuver: an Instant attack of the Simple Profile and Physical Foundation, your Melee Range 2 Squares further for it.
text: >
  (2)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, you may make an Attacking Maneuver of the Simple Profile and the Physical Foundation. If you do, you may treat your Melee Range as if it was 2 Squares further for the duration of this Attacking Maneuver.
